From: SaaiOS <os@saaios>
Subject: synaptics td4150: since37 defer 0x45 until panel, unmask IDENTIFY IRQ

since36: after stock 0x45 the IC acks 0x1b HDL v2 idle and stays RomBoot
0x04. 0x42 and 0x40 ETIME. Completing waiters on 0x1b did not start FW.
gpio=0 + irq_en=1 + ~284 IRQs is not a 0x1b livelock.

Touch probe is device_initcall (~1.07s). decon_initial_display is
late_initcall. lcd_power_ctrl is resume-only. HDL before DDI/MIPI:
ROM accepts SPI 0x45 but does not execute.

Stock write_message does not wait for ATTN idle. 8-frame drain already
failed. Do not complete 0x40/0x42 on 0x1b. No ENABLE_REPORT, polling,
97k retry, lcd_rst pulse, touch_init in 0x04, or force 0x30.

since37:
- Defer 0x45 until first unblank (panel enabled). Then stock 0x45+0x42.
  If 0x45 already went out, retry 0x42 once after panel, not 97k.
- ISR must not hold/mask IRQ after 0x45 / during 0x42 wait (IDENTIFY
  cannot arrive while disable_irq; irq_enabled stays 1).
- Dump cold-boot IDENTIFY 24 bytes. Log SPI Hz (clamp >7MHz to stock
  0x6acfc0). Log irq gpio/flags (LEVEL_LOW|ONESHOT).
- Keep since24-since36 probe markers.

Applies after syna-tcm-romboot-0x40-status-ok.patch.

